@startuml
actor User
participant "Webpage (DOM/Text Field)" as Page
participant "Content Script\n(Grammarly-check.js)" as CS
participant "Google Docs Canvas CS\n(Grammarly-gDocs.js)" as GDocs
participant "Service Worker\n(sw.js / Grammarly-bg.js)" as SW
database "chrome.storage.local" as Storage
participant "Grammarly Telemetry\n(gnar.grammarly.com)" as Gnar
participant "Checking API\n(capi.grammarly.com)" as Capi
participant "OAuth / Account\n(auth.grammarly.com)" as Auth

== Onboarding & Initialization ==
User -> Page: Loads page (e.g. Google Docs)
CS -> SW: runtime.sendMessage("settingsMessage")
SW -> Storage: get("preferences")
Storage --> SW: Caches preferences
SW --> CS: Sends active editor settings

== Real-Time Writing Assistance ==
User -> Page: Inputs text into field
Page -> CS: Intercepts text/selection events
CS -> SW: runtime.sendMessage("cheetah", {text})
SW -> Capi: Send text checking query over WebSocket (wss://capi.grammarly.com)
Capi --> SW: Return suggestions & corrections list
SW -> Storage: set("session_storage_logs_backup", logs)
SW --> CS: sendMessage("alertsCount", {count})
SW --> CS: sendMessage("shortFormCard", {htmlContent})
CS -> Page: Renders inline underline highlights & Suggestion Card UI

== Telemetry & Analytics ==
Page -> CS: User clicks suggestion card (accepts suggestion)
CS -> SW: sendMessage("actionNotification", {actionType: "accept"})
SW -> Gnar: POST to https://gnar.grammarly.com with telemetry data
SW -> Storage: set("gnar_nextPingTimestamp", timestamp)

== Google Docs Deep Integration ==
User -> Page: Edits a Google Doc
GDocs -> SW: runtime.sendMessage("settingsMessage")
GDocs -> Page: Injects canvas overlays and custom inline sidebar
SW -> Capi: Document text check pipeline (https://dox.grammarly.com)
@enduml